+
+Web Interface & API Subsystem
+=============================
+
+Added
+-----
+* **Flask-CORS Strict Localhost Whitelist Integration** (``app/api/security.py``, ``app/config.py``, ``requirements.txt``, ``.env.example``):
+  - Added ``flask-cors>=4.0.0`` dependency.
